{
  "id": "notes-api-dockerfile",
  "title": {
    "tr": "API için Dockerfile",
    "en": "A Dockerfile for the API"
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "language": "docker",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "entry": "Dockerfile",
  "files": [
    {
      "name": "Dockerfile",
      "starter": "starter-Dockerfile.{lang}",
      "solution": "solution-Dockerfile"
    },
    {
      "name": "app.py",
      "readonly": true
    },
    {
      "name": "healthcheck.py",
      "readonly": true
    },
    {
      "name": "requirements.txt",
      "readonly": true
    }
  ],
  "timeout_sec": 180,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Sıra: `WORKDIR` → `COPY requirements.txt .` → `RUN pip install ...` → `COPY app.py healthcheck.py ./` → `EXPOSE` → `CMD`.",
      "en": "Order: `WORKDIR` → `COPY requirements.txt .` → `RUN pip install ...` → `COPY app.py healthcheck.py ./` → `EXPOSE` → `CMD`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**Dockerfile**\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM python:3.13-slim\n\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY requirements.txt .\nRUN pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements.txt\nCOPY app.py healthcheck.py ./\n\nEXPOSE 8000\nCMD [\"python\", \"app.py\"]\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**Dockerfile**\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM python:3.13-slim\n\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY requirements.txt .\nRUN pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements.txt\nCOPY app.py healthcheck.py ./\n\nEXPOSE 8000\nCMD [\"python\", \"app.py\"]\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "dockerfile",
      "rule": "order",
      "steps": [
        {
          "instruction": "FROM",
          "value": "^python:3\\.13-slim$",
          "show": "FROM python:3.13-slim"
        },
        {
          "instruction": "WORKDIR",
          "value": "^/app/?$",
          "show": "WORKDIR /app"
        },
        {
          "instruction": "COPY",
          "value": "^requirements\\.txt ",
          "show": "COPY requirements.txt ."
        },
        {
          "instruction": "RUN",
          "value": "pip install .*-r requirements\\.txt",
          "show": "RUN pip install ... -r requirements.txt"
        },
        {
          "instruction": "COPY",
          "value": "app\\.py",
          "show": "COPY app.py healthcheck.py ./"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dockerfile",
      "rule": "exec_form",
      "instruction": "CMD",
      "args": [
        "python",
        "app.py"
      ],
      "show": "CMD [\"python\", \"app.py\"]"
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "expect": {
        "workdir": "/app",
        "exposed": [
          8000
        ],
        "file_exists": [
          "/app/healthcheck.py"
        ],
        "http": {
          "port": 8000,
          "path": "/health",
          "json": {
            "status": "ok"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
